  "安装在服务器上继续，关闭页面也不会中断。": "The install continues on the server. Closing the page won't stop it.",
  "这像是 DeepSeek、OpenAI 等第三方模型的 Key，CodeBuddy 会拒绝；第三方 Key 请在个人配置中改填到 Claude Code 或 Codex 凭证并设置 Base URL": "This looks like a key for a third-party model such as DeepSeek or OpenAI. CodeBuddy rejects it. Put third-party keys in Personal settings under the Claude Code or Codex credentials, and set a Base URL",
  "把专用公钥添加到代码托管账号，并按需授予仓库写权限": "Add the dedicated public key to your code hosting account, and grant repository write access if needed",
  "到「个人配置 → Git SSH 密钥」为该主机添加无口令私钥，同一主机的仓库自动共用；请管理员信任该 SSH 主机": "Go to \"Personal settings → Git SSH keys\" and add a passphrase-free private key for this host. Repositories on the same host share it. Ask an admin to trust this SSH host",
  "回到这里重试": "Come back here and retry",
  "到「个人配置」点击「连接 GitHub」，复制设备码后前往 GitHub 授权": "Go to \"Personal settings\" and click \"Connect GitHub\". Copy the device code, then authorize on GitHub",
  "添加仓库时点击「选择我的 GitHub 仓库」，选择仓库与主分支": "When adding a repository, click \"Select my GitHub repositories\" and choose the repository and main branch",
  "管理员尚未配置 GitHub 授权时，也可以手动填写有 Contents 和 Pull requests 读写权限的 PAT": "If an admin hasn't set up GitHub authorization, you can also enter a PAT with read and write access to Contents and Pull requests",
  "回到这里点「重试节点」": "Come back here and click \"Retry step\"",
  "在 CodeBuddy 账号所在站点（国际站、国内站或 iOA）创建 API Key 并复制": "Create an API Key on the site your CodeBuddy account uses (international, China, or iOA) and copy it",
  "到「个人配置 → CodeBuddy API Key」选择同一网络环境，粘贴 Key 并保存；DeepSeek 等第三方模型的 Key 不能用在这里": "Go to \"Personal settings → CodeBuddy API Key\", pick the same network environment, paste the key and save. Keys for third-party models such as DeepSeek don't work here",
  "到「个人配置 → Codex API Key」填写 Key（及 Base URL）并保存，或把执行机器的认证方式切回本机登录": "Go to \"Personal settings → Codex API Key\", enter the key (and Base URL) and save. Or switch the execution machine's auth back to local sign-in",
  "到「个人配置 → Claude Code API Key」填写 Key（及 Base URL）并保存，或把执行机器的认证方式切回本机登录": "Go to \"Personal settings → Claude Code API Key\", enter the key (and Base URL) and save. Or switch the execution machine's auth back to local sign-in",
