  "可以继续按浅灰、深灰的层级统一交互：悬停用轻微的灰色扩散，选中保持固定浅灰底，图标播放自身动效。\\n\\n按钮本身保持位置稳定，鼠标移开后颜色自然收回。": "We can keep unifying the interactions in light gray and dark gray levels: hover uses a soft gray spread, the selected state keeps a fixed light gray background, and icons play their own animation.\\n\\nThe button itself stays in place, and the color fades back when the mouse leaves.",
