  "打开后，运行会停在「待我确认」": "When on, the run stops at \"Awaiting my approval\"",
  "由平台到代码托管平台核验，无需编写命令：本轮推送了新提交的每个仓库，都必须有从本轮工作分支到目标分支、且未关闭的 MR/PR。无法自动查询的平台会转人工确认。": "The platform checks the code hosting platform, no commands needed: every repository with new commits pushed this round must have an open MR/PR from this round's work branch to the target branch. Platforms that can't be queried automatically go to manual confirmation.",
  "平台内建": "Built-in",
  "开启后，这个角色运行时通过平台 MCP（agentflow-platform）直接调用平台侧功能：需求、任务、运行、项目等平台操作。": "When on, this role calls platform features directly through the platform MCP (agentflow-platform) at run time: requirements, tasks, runs, projects and other platform operations.",
  "开启后，这个角色运行时可只读检索团队知识库（agentflow-knowledge），并自动附带「知识库使用规范」规则；产出的 knowledge.md 会进入知识沉淀审核队列。": "When on, this role can search the team knowledge base read-only at run time (agentflow-knowledge), and the \"Knowledge usage guidelines\" rule is attached automatically. The knowledge.md it produces enters the knowledge capture review queue.",
