  "运行到该节点时用所选模型构建静态站点，不必再手写脚本节点；Run 成功后平台归档预览。它只有成功出口。": "When the run reaches this step, it builds a static site with the chosen model, so no script step is needed. After a successful Run the platform archives the preview. It has only a success exit.",
  "从左侧「成功」出口连到下一步；预览节点没有失败出口": "Connect from the \"Success\" exit on the left to the next step. Preview steps have no failure exit",
