  "重置目标步骤及其下游后重跑。也可以从节点的「失败打回」出口直接拖线。": "Reset the target step and its downstream steps, then rerun. You can also drag a line from the step's \"Send back on failure\" exit.",
  "重试用尽后标记失败；运行页可以人工通过该节点继续下游。": "Marked as failed after retries run out. On the run page you can manually pass this step to continue downstream.",
