  "根据需求输入与代码库现状，确认目标、范围、排除项与验收标准，产出结构化需求说明与执行计划。": "Confirm the goal, scope, exclusions and acceptance criteria from the requirement input and the current codebase. Produce a structured requirement spec and an execution plan.",
  "分析受影响模块与调用链，设计接口、数据模型与最小改动方案，明确风险与验证范围。": "Analyze affected modules and call chains. Design the interfaces, data model and a minimal-change plan. State the risks and the verification scope.",
  "按方案与计划完成代码实现，运行受影响模块的单元测试并记录变更报告。": "Implement the code per the plan, run unit tests of the affected modules and record a change report.",
  "独立审查代码改动的正确性、回归风险、安全边界与测试证据，给出评审结论。": "Independently review the code changes for correctness, regression risk, security boundaries and test evidence. Give a review conclusion.",
  "按验收标准执行自动化或回归测试，核对每条验收项并输出测试报告。": "Run automated or regression tests against the acceptance criteria, check each acceptance item and output a test report.",
  "将工作分支推送到代码仓库，创建或更新 Pull Request 并整理变更摘要。": "Push the working branch to the repository, create or update the Pull Request and write a change summary.",
  "汇总本次交付的改动、验证结果与 MR 链接，提炼可复用的项目经验。": "Summarize the changes, verification results and MR link of this delivery, and extract reusable project experience.",
