  "<div class=\"approval-callout queued-run-callout\"><b>排队中，获得项目名额后自动启动</b><p>每个项目最多同时占用 10 条顶层 SOP，子 SOP 共享父级名额；未获准入和成功运行不占名额；一旦获准入即占用，失败、待确认、暂停及获准入后取消仍占用名额。可取消排队后删除记录。</p></div>": "<div class=\"approval-callout queued-run-callout\"><b>Queued. Starts automatically when the project has a slot</b><p>Each project can hold up to 10 top-level SOPs at the same time. Child SOPs share the parent's slot. Runs not yet admitted and successful runs do not take a slot. Once admitted, a run takes a slot. Failed, pending confirmation, paused, and canceled-after-admission runs still take a slot. You can cancel the queue and then delete the record.</p></div>",
